# linkedin-scraper-mcp

This package was renamed to [`mcp-server-linkedin`](https://pypi.org/project/mcp-server-linkedin/).

It now depends on `mcp-server-linkedin` and forwards to it, so existing setups keep working. To use the new name directly:

```bash
uvx mcp-server-linkedin@latest
```

Source: https://github.com/stickerdaniel/linkedin-mcp-server
